msgctxt "428"
msgid "Don't Order Anything"
msgstr "Non ordinare nulla"

msgctxt "449"
msgid "Check Out"
msgstr "Conto"

msgctxt "459"
msgid "Order"
msgstr "Ordina"

msgctxt "465"
msgid "(I'm short on cash.)"
msgstr "(Sono a corto di soldi.)  "

msgctxt "486"
msgid "(I can't carry any more stuff.)"
msgstr "(Non posso trasportare altri oggetti.)"

msgctxt "518"
msgid "(I can't handle any more turtles.)"
msgstr "(Non posso trasportare altre tartarughe.)"

msgctxt "553"
msgid "(I didn't choose anything.)"
msgstr "(Non ho scelto niente.)"

msgctxt "581"
msgid "(They're sold out.)"
msgstr "(Sono esauriti.)"

msgctxt "601"
msgid "Okay. That comes to %s."
msgstr "Va bene. Il totale è di %s."

msgctxt "625"
msgid ""
"This'll make you popular with the ladies, I guarantee\n"
"it."
msgstr "Questo ti renderà popolare con le donne, te lo garantisco."

msgctxt "683"
msgid ""
"Rumored to bring good luck to its wearer. I vouch for\n"
"it myself."
msgstr "Si dice che porti fortuna a chi lo indossa. Lo garantisco io stesso."

msgctxt "748"
msgid ""
"Someone who was desperate for cash brought this\n"
"thing in. Please just take it off my hands."
msgstr ""
"Qualcuno disperato per i soldi ha portato questa roba. Ti prego, toglimela "
"di torno."

msgctxt "840"
msgid ""
"This belt is authentic tiger skin, not some imitation.\n"
"Its protective qualities are the real deal, too."
msgstr ""
"Questa cintura è di autentica pelle di tigre, non un'imitazione. Anche le "
"sue qualità protettive sono autentiche."

msgctxt "944"
msgid ""
"They say equipping three Sacred Tree items at once\n"
"will help protect you from bullets."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1031"
msgid ""
"This chain mail is very lightweight compared to \n"
"Western versions. You'll find that it's quite effective\n"
"against bladed weapons."
msgstr ""
"Questa cotta di maglia è molto leggera rispetto alle  versioni occidentali. "
"Scoprirai che è piuttosto efficace contro le armi da taglio."

msgctxt "1160"
msgid ""
"This chain mail dates back to Japan's Sengoku period.\n"
"It still provides solid protection against bladed\n"
"weapons."
msgstr ""
"Questa cotta di maglia risale al periodo Sengoku del Giappone. Fornisce "
"ancora una solida protezione contro le armi da taglio."

msgctxt "1273"
msgid ""
"This ancient Chinese inkstone dates back 300 years. \n"
"The poem engraved on it is in honor of a war god."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1376"
msgid ""
"This small kettle is the perfect size for a bachelor like\n"
"yourself. Its unusual thickness might work especially\n"
"well for someone like you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1515"
msgid "Just a regular block of brass. Great for making statues."
msgstr "Solo un normale blocco di ottone. Ottimo per fare statue."

msgctxt "1572"
msgid ""
"The irregular shape of this pearl makes it less\n"
"valuable than round ones, but some people prefer\n"
"them."
msgstr ""
"La forma irregolare di questa perla la rende meno preziosa di quelle "
"rotonde, ma alcune persone le preferiscono."

msgctxt "1675"
msgid ""
"This vegetable grater was made by a famous artisan \n"
"exclusively for grating white radish. It certainly gets\n"
"the job done."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1797"
msgid ""
"This black shaft is a top-quality brand of club. It's sure\n"
"to get your foes airborne... Not that I'd recommend\n"
"using it for that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1927"
msgid ""
"Ah, the bat. I sell bats as a hobby, you know. This \n"
"one's great for sandlot games."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2011"
msgid ""
"Even though this short sword lacks a maker's mark, \n"
"it'll cut better than any factory-made one."
msgstr ""
"Anche se questa spada corta non ha un marchio di fabbrica,  taglierà meglio "
"di qualsiasi altra spada prodotta in serie."

msgctxt "2107"
msgid ""
"The Kogarasu Maru. If it's genuine, it would be a \n"
"national treasure, but I haven't gotten it appraised.\n"
"Either way, it's razor-sharp."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2242"
msgid ""
"Even though this katana lacks a maker's mark, it'll cut\n"
"better than any factory-made one."
msgstr ""
"Anche se questa katana non ha un marchio di fabbrica, taglierà meglio di "
"qualsiasi altra spada prodotta in serie."

msgctxt "2332"
msgid ""
"This ornate blade is etched with a beautiful and \n"
"intricate carp pattern. Its craftsmanship is of the \n"
"highest quality."
msgstr ""
"Questa lama ornata è incisa con un bellissimo e intricato motivo a carpa. La"
" sua fattura è della più alta qualità."

msgctxt "2452"
msgid ""
"This ancient Unarmed Gion Style Tome is from the \n"
"Edo Period and was written by Sozaemon Komaki."
msgstr ""
